ounded noun resets","verified_at":"2026-10-02T02:05:41Z"}},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberia-to/zheng/commits/0d7ba6d422d9b825f9685e903e55252f88ebecd9","html_url":"https://github.com/cyberia-to/zheng/commit/0d7ba6d422d9b825f9685e903e55252f88ebecd9","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberia-to/zheng/commits/0d7ba6d422d9b825f9685e903e55252f88ebecd9/comments","author":{"login":"mastercyb","id":410789,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQxMDc4OQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/410789?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mastercyb","html_url":"https://github.com/mastercyb","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mastercyb/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mastercyb/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mastercyb/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mastercyb/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mastercyb/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mastercyb/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mastercyb/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mastercyb/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mastercyb/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"committer":{"login":"web-flow","id":19864447,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"parents":[{"sha":"e4959de00d3d12727877100e304d8dd155b0b0f5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberia-to/zheng/commits/e4959de00d3d12727877100e304d8dd155b0b0f5","html_url":"https://github.com/cyberia-to/zheng/commit/e4959de00d3d12727877100e304d8dd155b0b0f5"},{"sha":"7771326096ba6c9c1ab0e60f035d6a0123549e2c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberia-to/zheng/commits/7771326096ba6c9c1ab0e60f035d6a0123549e2c","html_url":"https://github.com/cyberia-to/zheng/commit/7771326096ba6c9c1ab0e60f035d6a0123549e2c"}]}],"files":[{"sha":"4d9bcd5b1aca81edba02c8d29bcd179e1b432e53","filename":"audit/compact-noun-admission/README.md","status":"added","additions":26,"deletions":0,"changes":26,"blob_url":"https://github.com/cyberia-to/zheng/blob/0d7ba6d422d9b825f9685e903e55252f88ebecd9/audit%2Fcompact-noun-admission%2FREADME.md","raw_url":"https://github.com/cyberia-to/zheng/raw/0d7ba6d422d9b825f9685e903e55252f88ebecd9/audit%2Fcompact-noun-admission%2FREADME.md","contents_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberia-to/zheng/contents/audit%2Fcompact-noun-admission%2FREADME.md?ref=0d7ba6d422d9b825f9685e903e55252f88ebecd9","patch":"@@ -0,0 +1,26 @@\n+# Compact noun admission\n+\n+`Memory::append_value` accepts disclosed atom/pair data and derives its particle\n+and Cost through the same private validation path as claimed definitions. A\n+future stream can omit those redundant fields. Root binding remains explicit;\n+this change adds no execution proof or transport format.\n+\n+Validation used Zheng base `b6ee58895ad99fc08e2add7870f9b958171b0a75` plus the\n+four exact files in `source.json`. `receipt.json` retains commands, original log\n+hashes and exit statuses. Every command explicitly used `rustup run 1.89.0 cargo`\n+with locked offline dependencies and two build jobs.\n+\n+| Cargo command suffix | Result |\n+|---|---|\n+| `test --workspace --release --locked --offline -- --test-threads=2` | 242 passed, zero failed, one existing ignored |\n+| `test -p zheng --release --locked --offline --all-features disclosed::memory -- --nocapture` | 11 passed |\n+| `test -p zheng --release --locked --offline --all-features --test disclosed_memory_allocation -- --nocapture` | two actual allocation-failure/retry tests passed |\n+| `check --workspace --all-targets --release --locked --offline --all-features` | passed, zero warnings |\n+\n+All command logs contain zero warnings. Existing native differential fixtures\n+now compare claimed and compact admission record-for-record, including every\n+Cost rule and saturated/full-u64 bounds. New cases reject noncanonical values,\n+future/self references, exceeded capacity and incorrect expected root bindings.\n+The isolated allocator test exercises first allocation and growth refusal for\n+both public entries. Independent read-only review found no correctness issue;\n+`review.json` binds the reviewed files. No new performance measurement is made."},{"sha":"fb7dea4e52529f2dc548d8e4af5df6ab3f6b30f0","filename":"audit/compact-noun-admission/allocation-all-features.log","status":"added","additions":9,"deletions":0,"changes":9,"blob_url":"https://github.com/cyberia-to/zheng/blob/0d7ba6d422d9b825f9685e903e55252f88ebecd9/audit%2Fcompact-noun-admission%2Fallocation-all-features.log","raw_url":"https://github.com/cyberia-to/zheng/raw/0d7ba6d422d9b825f9685e903e55252f88ebecd9/audit%2Fcompact-noun-admission%2Fallocation-all-features.log","contents_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberia-to/zheng/contents/audit%2Fcompact-noun-admission%2Fallocation-all-features.log?ref=0d7ba6d422d9b825f9685e903e55252f88ebecd9","patch":"@@ -0,0 +1,9 @@\n+    Finished `release` profile [optimized] target(s) in 0.02s\n+     Running tests/disclosed_memory_allocation.rs (/Users/master/cyber/.worktrees/selfhost-0.4-finalization-20261002/proof/zheng/target/release/deps/disclosed_memory_allocation-f2214be90d629cc1)\n+\n+running 2 tests\n+test compact_value_admission_handles_allocation_failure_without_partial_records ... ok\n+test failed_growth_preserves_validated_records_and_allows_retry ... ok\n+\n+test result: ok. 2 passed; 0 failed; 0 ignored; 0 measured; 0 filtered out; finished in 0.00s\n+"},{"sha":"24dbd0142ce6f1841c133d2be8a93716f6b5328f","filename":"audit/compact-noun-admission/check.log","status":"added","additions":22,"deletions":0,"changes":22,"blob_url":"https://github.com/cyberia-to/zheng/blob/0d7ba6d422d9b825f9685e903e55252f88ebecd9/audit%2Fcompact-noun-admission%2Fcheck.log","raw_url":"https://github.com/cyberia-to/zheng/raw/0d7ba6d422d9b825f9685e903e55252f88ebecd9/audit%2Fcompact-noun-admission%2Fcheck.log","contents_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberia-to/zheng/contents/audit%2Fcompact-noun-admission%2Fcheck.log?ref=0d7ba6d422d9b825f9685e903e55252f88ebecd9","patch":"@@ -0,0 +1,22 @@\n+    Checking strata-core v0.1.1 (/Users/master/cyber/.worktrees/selfhost-0.4-finalization-20261002/stream/strata/core)\n+    Checking cyber-hemera v0.3.1 (/Users/master/cyber/.worktrees/selfhost-0.4-finalization-20261002/stream/hemera/rs)\n+    Checking strata-ext v0.1.1 (/Users/master/cyber/.worktrees/selfhost-0.4-finalization-20261002/stream/strata/ext)\n+    Checking strata-proof v0.1.1 (/Users/master/cyber/.worktrees/selfhost-0.4-finalization-20261002/stream/strata/proof)\n+    Checking strata-compute v0.1.1 (/Users/master/cyber/.worktrees/selfhost-0.4-finalization-20261002/stream/strata/compute)\n+    Checking strata-nebu v0.1.1 (/Users/master/cyber/.worktrees/selfhost-0.4-finalization-20261002/stream/strata/nebu/rs)\n+    Checking strata-jali v0.1.1 (/Users/master/cyber/.worktrees/selfhost-0.4-finalization-20261002/stream/strata/jali/rs)\n+    Checking cyber-lens-core v0.1.2 (/Users/master/cyber/.worktrees/selfhost-0.4-finalization-