... ok\n+test execution::disclosed::evaluation::tests::adversarial::equality_and_premise_keys_use_particles_across_duplicate_occurrences ... ok\n+test execution::disclosed::evaluation::tests::differential::axis_zero_and_hash_have_distinct_native_results_and_logical_step_counts ... ok\n+test execution::disclosed::evaluation::tests::adversarial::outputs_bind_ordered_topology_and_all_root_particle_limbs ... ok\n+test execution::disclosed::evaluation::tests::adversarial::exact_and_one_below_resource_limits_fail_without_mutation ... ok\n+test execution::disclosed::evaluation::tests::adversarial::computed_continuation_binds_both_child_results_as_its_key ... ok\n+test execution::disclosed::memory::tests::canonical_atom_and_particle_domains_reject_aliases ... ok\n+test execution::disclosed::memory::tests::ordered_topology_and_strict_prior_references_are_checked_atomically ... ok\n+test execution::disclosed::memory::tests::views_reject_future_reads_and_bind_every_expected_root_limb ... ok\n+test execution::disclosed::evaluation::tests::adversarial::changing_the_selected_arm_rejects_even_when_the_forged_result_matches_it ... ok\n+test execution::disclosed::stream::tests::adversarial::stale_generations_empty_slots_wrong_keys_and_generation_overflow_reject ... ok\n+test execution::disclosed::evaluation::tests::adversarial::malformed_formulas_invalid_types_and_inverse_zero_have_no_success_rule ... ok\n+test execution::disclosed::stream::tests::adversarial::invalid_types_inverse_zero_and_service_invocations_poison ... ok\n+test execution::disclosed::stream::tests::adversarial::exact_resource_caps_and_one_below_are_enforced_with_full_cached_charge ... ok\n+test execution::disclosed::stream::tests::adversarial::selected_branch_and_computed_continuation_keys_survive_reset_and_reject_changes ... ok\n+test execution::disclosed::memory::tests::record_and_buffer_limits_accept_exact_capacity_and_fail_closed_below ... ok\n+test execution::disclosed::memory::tests::saturated_u64_costs_do_n