tests::differential::canonical_field_word_and_hash_boundaries_match_native ... ok\n+test execution::disclosed::evaluation::tests::differential::all_pure_patterns_match_native_values_costs_and_frame_boundaries ... ok\n+test execution::disclosed::stream::tests::differential::all_native_rules_match_finite_dag_across_a_fresh_noun_table_per_event ... ok\n+test execution::disclosed::stream::tests::adversarial::checked_metric_overflow_rejects_exponentially_shared_evaluations ... ok\n+\n+test result: ok. 40 passed; 0 failed; 0 ignored; 0 measured; 226 filtered out; finished in 0.05s\n+"},{"sha":"b84f52675633eac1c479d749029237d2319ceee4","filename":"audit/disclosed-semantic-stream/allocation-all-features.log","status":"added","additions":9,"deletions":0,"changes":9,"blob_url":"https://github.com/cyberia-to/zheng/blob/0d7ba6d422d9b825f9685e903e55252f88ebecd9/audit%2Fdisclosed-semantic-stream%2Fallocation-all-features.log","raw_url":"https://github.com/cyberia-to/zheng/raw/0d7ba6d422d9b825f9685e903e55252f88ebecd9/audit%2Fdisclosed-semantic-stream%2Fallocation-all-features.log","contents_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberia-to/zheng/contents/audit%2Fdisclosed-semantic-stream%2Fallocation-all-features.log?ref=0d7ba6d422d9b825f9685e903e55252f88ebecd9","patch":"@@ -0,0 +1,9 @@\n+   Compiling zheng v0.4.0 (/Users/master/cyber/.worktrees/selfhost-0.4-finalization-20261002/semantic/zheng/rs)\n+    Finished `release` profile [optimized] target(s) in 2.58s\n+     Running tests/disclosed_stream_allocation.rs (target/release/deps/disclosed_stream_allocation-6d62ad46d3bd97d3)\n+\n+running 1 test\n+test constructor_failures_are_fallible_and_events_need_no_allocations ... ok\n+\n+test result: ok. 1 passed; 0 failed; 0 ignored; 0 measured; 0 filtered out; finished in 0.00s\n+"},{"sha":"169cfda0bcee0c286086dcee8b3fbbe5c8a942fd","filename":"audit/disclosed-semantic-stream/allocation-default.log","status":"added","additions":9,"deletions":0,"changes":9,"blob_url":"https://github.com/cyber